ents playing other hobbies - Students who like to paint\n- Students who like to dance = 74 - 56 = 18 students\n\nTherefore, the number of students who like to dance is 18.\n</think>\n<answer>18 students like to dance.</answer>", "model_answer": 18.0, "ground_truth": 18.0, "is_correct": true}
