 \\text{ plants/ledge} = 216 \\text{ plants}\n     \\]\n5. **Remaining Potted Plants**: To find out how many potted plants Aisha will remain with, we subtract the number of plants to give away from the total number of plants before giving away:\n   \\[\n   468 \\text{ total plants} - 216 \\text{ plants to give away} = 252 \\text{ plants}\n   \\]\n\nTherefore, Aisha will remain with 252 potted plants.\n</think>\n<answer>\nAisha will remain with 252 potted plants.\n</answer>", "model_answer": 252.0, "ground_truth": 252.0, "is_correct": true}
