he total number of questions Valentina is sure to get correct:**\n   - Total correct questions: 6 (economics) + 8 (literature) = 14 questions\n\n5. **Calculate the total points Valentina is sure to get:**\n   - Assuming each correct answer is worth 1 point, Valentina is sure to get 14 points.\n\nTherefore, Valentina is sure to get 14 points.\n</think>\n<answer>Valentina is sure to get 14 points.</answer>", "model_answer": 14.0, "ground_truth": 21.0, "is_correct": false}
