ince we can only consume whole servings, the user can eat 1 serving of the 2 servings that have slightly fewer calories. Each of these servings is 300 oz, so the user can eat:\n\\[ 1 \\times 300 = 300 \\text{ oz} \\]\nTherefore, the user can eat 300 oz of the cookies.\n</think>\n<answer>\nThe user can eat 300 oz of the cookies.\n</answer>", "model_answer": 300.0, "ground_truth": 144.0, "is_correct": false}
