 Adjusted total cost\nOliver's remaining money = ₺66.14 - ₺8.58\nOliver's remaining money = ₺57.56\n\nTherefore, after paying for the anchors, Oliver has ₺57.56 left.\n</answer>", "model_answer": 57.56, "ground_truth": 56.0, "is_correct": false}
