gnatures from a festival, which are not part of their goal.\n\nTotal signatures they currently have:\n\\[ 28 + 59 - 4 = 83 \\]\n\nNext, we need to determine how many more signatures they need to reach their goal of 90 signatures:\n\\[ 90 - 83 = 7 \\]\n\nTherefore, Beatriz and Jasmine need to collect 7 more signatures in the remaining 2 weeks to reach their goal of 90 signatures.\n</answer>", "model_answer": 90.0, "ground_truth": 3.0, "is_correct": false}
