e included in the $13 per dozen price.\n   - Therefore, the cost of these 4 smaller eclairs is the same as the cost of 1 dozen smaller eclairs, which is $13.\n\n6. **Subtract the cost of the smaller eclairs from the total cost:**\n   - Total cost after adjustment = $883 - $13 = $870.\n\nThus, the total cost of the desserts, considering the smaller eclairs, is $870.\n</think>\n<answer>\n$870\n</answer>", "model_answer": 870.0, "ground_truth": 883.0, "is_correct": false}
