ni cheesecakes:\n- Priya bought 5 dozen mini cheesecakes.\n- Each dozen of mini cheesecakes costs $116.\n- Therefore, the total cost for the mini cheesecakes is 5 * $116 = $580.\n\nNow, we can sum up the costs of all the pastries to find the total cost:\nTotal cost = Cost of donuts + Cost of mini cupcakes + Cost of mini cheesecakes\nTotal cost = $52 + $664 + $580 = $1296.\n\nTherefore, the total cost for all the pastries is $1296.\n</answer>", "model_answer": 1296.0, "ground_truth": 1296.0, "is_correct": true}
