sumption = 12\n\nFinally, we calculate how many days the pie will last:\nDays the pie will last = Total servings / Total daily consumption\nDays the pie will last = 12 / 12\nDays the pie will last = 1\nTherefore, the pie will last for 1 day.\n</answer>", "model_answer": 1.0, "ground_truth": 1.0, "is_correct": true}
