cost of the sea glass. Ananya bought a mixed bag of sea glass for €11.5.\n\nCost of sea glass = €11.5\n\nNow, let's calculate the cost of the stickers. Ananya bought 15 stickers at €20.5 each.\n\nCost of stickers = 15 * €20.5\nCost of stickers = €307.5\n\nNow, let's add up the total cost of all the items.\n\nTotal cost = Cost of rock candy + Cost of sea glass + Cost of stickers\nTotal cost = €412.5 + €11.5 + €307.5\nTotal cost = €731.5\n\nFinally, let's subtract the total cost from the initial amount of €1400 to find out how much money Ananya has left.\n\nMoney left = Initial amount - Total cost\nMoney left = €1400 - €731.5\nMoney left = €668.5\n\nTherefore, Ananya has €668.5 left.\n</answer>", "model_answer": 668.5, "ground_truth": 597.0, "is_correct": false}
