otal cost of rice = 14 kg * 30 per kg = 420\nFinally, we need to add the cost of the muffin, which is ₣1. So, the total cost is:\nTotal cost = Cost of rice + Cost of muffin = 420 + 1 = 421\nTherefore, the total cost of everything is ₣421.\n</answer>", "model_answer": 421.0, "ground_truth": 421.0, "is_correct": true}
