p by step.\n</think>\n<answer>\n- Revenue from tulips: 9 * $3 = $27.\n- Revenue from orchids: 19 * $5 = $95.\n- Revenue from daisies: 39 * $5 = $195.\n\nTotal revenue = $27 + $95 + $195 = $317.\n\nTherefore, Faisal will make $317 today.\n</answer>", "model_answer": 317.0, "ground_truth": 317.0, "is_correct": true}
