nds\n   - 15th day: 162.5 pounds\n   - Remaining 14 days: 4550 pounds\n   - Total = 4550 + 162.5 + 4550 = 9262.5 pounds\n\n8. **Round the final answer to the nearest whole number:**\n   - 9262.5 pounds rounds to 9263 pounds\n\nTherefore, 25 gnomes with mithril pickaxes can mine 9263 pounds of ore in a month with 29 days.\n</think>\n<answer>\n9263 pounds\n</answer>", "model_answer": 9263.0, "ground_truth": 9425.0, "is_correct": false}
