re mined by the 20 trolls with titanium pickaxes over the remaining 28 days:\n- 20 trolls * 15 kgs per troll = 300 kgs per day.\n\nFinally, we need to calculate the total ore mined over the 28 days:\n- 300 kgs per day * 28 days = 8400 kgs of ore.\n\nAdding the ore mined on the first day and the ore mined over the remaining 28 days, we get the total ore mined by the 20 trolls with titanium pickaxes in a month:\n- 195 kgs (first day) + 8400 kgs (remaining 28 days) = 8595 kgs of ore.\n\nTherefore, 20 trolls with titanium pickaxes can mine 8595 kgs of ore in a month with 29 days.\n</answer>", "model_answer": 29.0, "ground_truth": 8700.0, "is_correct": false}
