efore, Uma should bake 25 trays worth of cookies to use up all of her frosting.\n</think>\n<answer>\nUma should bake 25 trays worth of cookies to use up all of her frosting.\n</answer>", "model_answer": 25.0, "ground_truth": 38.0, "is_correct": false}
