r the same number of hours.\n   5 hours * ₺106/hour = ₺530\n3. Comparison:\n   If Camila hires the financial advisor, she will have ₺530 - ₺416 = ₺114 more money.\nTherefore, Camila will have ₺114 more money if she hires the financial advisor.\n</answer>", "model_answer": 114.0, "ground_truth": 310.0, "is_correct": false}
{"dataset": "GSM_Distracted", "item_id": 654, "question": "Amelia is trying to decide whether to do her financial planning herself or hire one accountant. If she does it herself, she'll be able to do 12 fewer hours of freelance work, losing €31/hour in missed income. She also plans to work 8 hours on a separate project that pays €20/hour, though this will not affect her financial planning decision. The accountant charges €76. How much more money will she have if she hires the accountant?", "prompt": "As an expert problem solver, solve step by step the following mathematical questions. Amelia is trying to decide whether to do her financial planning herself or hire one accountant. If she does it herself, she'll be able to do 12 fewer hours of freelance work, losing €31/hour in missed income. She also plans to work 8 hours on a separate project that pays €20/hour, though this will not affect her financial planning decision. The accountant charges €76. How much more money will she have if she hires the accountant?", "model_response": "<think>\nTo solve this problem, let's break it down step by step:\n\n1. **Identify the variables and given information:**\n   - Amelia's hourly rate for freelance work: €31/hour\n   - Number of hours lost by doing financial planning herself: 12 hours\n   - Separate project that pays €20/hour\n   - Cost of hiring an accountant: €76\n\n2. **Calculate the missed income from freelance work:**\n   - Missed income = 12 hours * €31/hour = €372\n\n3. **Calculate the income from the separate project:**\n   - Income from separate project = 8 hours * €20/hour = €160\n\n4. **Calculate the total missed income from freelance work:**\n   - Total missed income = €372 (from freelance work) - €160 (from separate project) = €212\n\n5. **Calculate the total missed income if Amelia hires the accountant:**\n   - Since hiring the accountant is the only decision, the missed income remains the same as calculated above: €212\n\n6. **Calculate the cost of hiring the accountant:**\n   - Cost of hiring the accountant = €76\n\n7. **Calculate the net missed income if Amelia hires the accountant:**\n   - Net missed income = €212 (total missed income) - €76 (cost of hiring the accountant) = €136\n\n8. **Determine how much more money Amelia will have if she hires the accountant:**\n   - If Amelia hires the accountant, she will have €136 more than if she does the financial planning herself.\n\nTherefore, Amelia will have €136 more if she hires the accountant.\n</think>\n<answer>\nAmelia will have €136 more if she hires the accountant.\n</answer>", "model_answer": 136.0, "ground_truth": 296.0, "is_correct": false}
