ols = (165 / 3) / (312 / 3) * 100 = 55 / 104 * 100\n\nNow, let's calculate the final percentage.\nPercentage of indigo spools = 55 / 104 * 100 ≈ 52.94%\n\nTherefore, the percentage of the spools that are indigo is approximately 52.94%.\n</think>\n<answer>\nThe percentage of the spools that are indigo is approximately 52.94%.\n</answer>", "model_answer": 52.94, "ground_truth": 55.0, "is_correct": false}
