*\n   - 1 hour = 60 minutes\n   - Total time in hours: 2800 minutes/week ÷ 60 minutes/hour = 46.67 hours/week\n\nTherefore, James spends approximately 46.67 hours a week learning.\n</think>\n<answer>James spends approximately 46.67 hours a week learning.</answer>", "model_answer": 46.67, "ground_truth": 60.0, "is_correct": false}
