pply the discount:\n   Total cost of headbands before coupon = 3 × $8 = $24\n   Total cost of headbands after coupon = $24 - $2 = $22\n4. Finally, we need to add up all the costs to find out how much Sofia spent on athletic gear:\n   Total cost = Jersey cost + Leggings cost + Sale price of cleats + Total cost of headbands after coupon\n   Total cost = $22 + $33 + $16 + $22\n   Total cost = $93\n</think>\n<answer>\nSofia spent a total of $93 on athletic gear.\n</answer>", "model_answer": 93.0, "ground_truth": 77.0, "is_correct": false}
