tal figs: \\(30 + 67 = 97\\)\n- Combined total: \\(97 + 146 = 243\\)\n\nThe combined total of the number of kiwis and figs Sanjay has in the house is 243.\n</think>\n<answer>243</answer>", "model_answer": 243.0, "ground_truth": 248.0, "is_correct": false}
