s 132.\nThe medium cubes used up 132 ounces of water because 12 times 11 equals 132.\nThe small cubes used up 6 ounces of water because 24 times 1/4 equals 6.\nThis means that Mateo has used up 270 ounces of water because 132 plus 132 plus 6 equals 270.\nMateo has 60 ounces of water left because 330 minus 270 equals 60.\n#### 60"}
