ill give away:\n   4 plants/ledge × 56 ledges = 224 plants\n\n3. Remaining potted plants:\n   448 plants - 224 plants = 224 plants\n\nTherefore, Amelia will remain with 224 potted plants.\n</answer>", "model_answer": 224.0, "ground_truth": 271.0, "is_correct": false, "original_answer_text": "Two days ago, before receiving the plants, Amelia had 56*8 = 448 potted plants\nAfter receiving an additional 47 plants, she therefore had a total of 448 + 47 = 495 potted plants\nTomorrow, Amelia's plant giveaway will be 56*4 = 224 potted plants.\nShe will therefore remain with 495 - 224 = 271 potted plants.\n#### 271"}
