": "A full outfit for each child will require 17 skeins per vest + 16 skeins per cardigan + 8 skeins per poncho + 4 skeins per pair of mittens + 11 skeins per pair of booties = 56 skeins of wool.\nSo to knit outfits for all of her grandchildren, she will need 4*56 = 224 skeins of wool.\n#### 224"}
