fter her purchases.\n</answer>", "model_answer": 892.0, "ground_truth": 608.0, "is_correct": false, "original_answer_text": "saltwater taffy is 15 kgs for ₺ 23 and gets 4 kgs 1/2 off. So 1/2 off of 4 kgs is ₺2*23 = ₺46. The rest of 4 kgs does not have discount and come at 92 so total is 15*23 + 4*1/2*23 + 4*23 = 483\n14 keychains at ₺21.25 each is 14*21.25=₺297.5\nWhen you add all her purchases, ₺483+₺11.5+₺297.5 = ₺792)\nShe had ₺1400 and spent ₺792 so she had ₺1400-₺792 = ₺608 left over\n#### 608"}
