he total cost for Yuki's week's worth of sugar and the cookie is ₱73.\n</answer>", "model_answer": 73.0, "ground_truth": 73.0, "is_correct": true, "original_answer_text": "The sugar he bought was 8*0.25=2 more expensive per kg than what he normally buys\nSo it cost 8+2=10 per kg\nHe goes through 1*7=7 kgs of sugar a week\nSo he paid 10.0*7=70 on sugar\nThat means his total bill was 70+3=73\n#### 73"}
