nce the number following the 1 is 5 or higher.\nIbrahim will round his tulips up from $2.53 to $3, since the number following the 2 is 5 or higher.\nIbrahim will round his sunflowers down from $6.4 to $6, since the number following the 6 is less than 5.\nIbrahim sells 9 roses x $2 = $18\nIbrahim sells 17 tulips x $3 = $51\nIbrahim sells 40 sunflowers x $6 = $240\nAltogether, Ibrahim will make $18 + $51 + $240 = $309\n#### 309"}
