.\n</think>\n<answer>\nCamila will have ₺310 more if she hires the financial advisor.\n</answer>", "model_answer": 310.0, "ground_truth": 310.0, "is_correct": true, "original_answer_text": "First find the total lost revenue if Camila does her financial planning herself: ₺52/hour * 8 hours = ₺416\nThen subtract the financial advisor's charge to find how much money Camila saves: ₺416 - ₺106 = ₺310\n#### 310"}
