ekly production for both Gabrielle and Olivia is 4620 customers.\n</answer>", "model_answer": 4620.0, "ground_truth": 4620.0, "is_correct": true, "original_answer_text": "While Olivia is processing 66 orders in a day, Gabrielle processes 66 orders/day * 9 = 594 orders/day.\nIn a day, they process 594 orders/day + 66 orders/day = 660 orders together.\nThe total number of orders the two processes in a week is 660 orders/day * 7 days/week = 4620 orders\n#### 4620"}
