a and Sofia is 3,325 customers.\n</answer>", "model_answer": 3325.0, "ground_truth": 3325.0, "is_correct": true, "original_answer_text": "While Sofia is processing 95 orders in a day, Olga processes 95 orders/day * 4 = 380 orders/day.\nIn a day, they process 380 orders/day + 95 orders/day = 475 orders together.\nThe total number of orders the two processes in a week is 475 orders/day * 7 days/week = 3325 orders\n#### 3325"}
